{"overview":"در آینده‌ای نزدیک، یک بازی نقش‌آفرینی آنلاین چندنفرهٔ واقعیت مجازی به نام Sword Art Online منتشر می‌شود که بازیکنان با استفاده از فناوری Nerve Gear بدن خود را به آواتارهایشان متصل می‌کنند. روزی متوجه می‌شوند که نمی‌توانند خارج شوند؛ خالق بازی آن‌ها را تا رسیدن به طبقهٔ صدم برج و شکست رئیس نهایی اسیر کرده است. اگر در بازی بمیرد، در دنیای واقعی هم می‌میرد. مبارزه برای بقا همین‌اکنون آغاز می‌شود.","tagline":"","overview_en":"In the near future, a Virtual Reality Massive Multiplayer Online Role-Playing Game (VRMMORPG) called Sword Art Online has been released where players control their avatars with their bodies using a piece of technology called Nerve Gear. One day, players discover they cannot log out, as the game creator is holding them captive unless they reach the 100th floor of the game's tower and defeat the final boss. However, if they die in the game, they die in real life. Their struggle for survival starts now...","tagline_en":"Blurring the line between the virtual and the real.","runtime":24,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":25,"y":2012,"poster":"/zFx3wNdmMqNLPH7q4ZIE7EEdjxb.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":25,"y":2012,"poster":"/3N9j3R3XVaFouGY3dEhZwAHIJHG.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":24,"y":2014,"poster":"/ycCgDrMbUVx0hmwLikCUfv1lETG.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":24,"y":2018,"poster":"/x1v7jxAv3GqNVC8oCsVyicrY5mr.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":23,"y":2019,"poster":"/Aa39R4MynJlUtCBHfAXMEf6Dhpp.jpg"}],"episodes":96,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"松岡禎丞","role":"Kirito (voice)","photo":"/ugDwdWEXnmv43jcbnfAi4XwiQ8C.jpg","en":"Yoshitsugu Matsuoka"},{"name":"戸松遥","role":"Asuna (voice)","photo":"/geVvuA2zMGE5xzfc20aDelJSelu.jpg","en":"Haruka Tomatsu"},{"name":"平田広明","role":"Klein (voice)","photo":"/mMWEdlssJm3TVuXW4Wb7pQeX20Z.jpg","en":"Hiroaki Hirata"},{"name":"茅野愛衣","role":"Alice Synthesis Thirty (voice)","photo":"/l8ywp387rfdAS7mOExe3cEZnsk0.jpg","en":"Ai Kayano"},{"name":"日高里菜","role":"S